    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl">Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">Last updated 6 October 2026.</p>
    <h2>The service</h2>
    <p>Kora Desk provides WhatsApp-based assistants for orders, payments, stock, and books. Agents do not move money without an approval from you.</p>
    <h2>Pilots</h2>
    <p>The 14-day pilot is free and needs no card. We may refuse or end a pilot if the number is used for abuse or spam.</p>
    <h2>Your responsibilities</h2>
    <p>You confirm you have the right to connect the WhatsApp number and to process your customers’ messages. You review high-value orders and all refunds.</p>
    <h2>Limits</h2>
    <p>The demo and the ROI calculator show estimates, not promises. Hours saved and matching accuracy vary by shop.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
